摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Delete one complete turn from a DeepSeek Harness session without deleting the session","id":"gh:1337335939","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-turn-delete","slug":"hanshenmesen/dsh-turn-delete","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Delete one complete turn from a DeepSeek Harness session without deleting the session"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-turn-delete"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Delete one complete closed turn from a DeepSeek Harness conversation without deleting or replacing t"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"he Session. The action appears beside the final assistant response for each completed top-level turn"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e Session. The action appears beside the final assistant response for each completed top-level turn."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Delete the middle turn after confirmation while keeping the same Session and its later turn. This wa"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"s recorded through the real DeepSeek model flow on DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.7`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"From npm (recommended):"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"From GitHub:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"From a prebuilt GitHub Release:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installation. To remove it:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Behavior"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- A trash action appears only on completed ordinary Session turns. Subagent transcripts do not expos"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e it.\n- Deletion requires confirmation and is disabled while the Session is running.\n- The prompt, a"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ssistant messages, and tool records for the selected turn are removed from the Session's current mod"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"el surface.\n- The Session id, title, workspace association, later turns, and original append-only ev"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ent log remain intact.\n- A durable zero-content replacement event records the deletion. Reloading th"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"e page or restarting the profile preserves it.\n- Repeating the same request is idempotent."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin refuses deletion when the target turn is still open or has already been merged into a com"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"paction replacement with other history. This prevents deleting only part of model-visible context."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Design"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The Host half registers `POST /dsh-turn-delete`, claims the target Agent's maintenance lease, valida"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tes the complete closed-turn surface span, appends a zero-content replacement, and waits for `sessio"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ns.flush()` before acknowledging success."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The browser half contributes to the public `conversation.chat.assistant-actions` and `conversation.c"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"hat.turnTail` slots. A Conversation definition projects the durable tombstone onto the target Turn. "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"DeepSeek Harness does not yet expose a public whole-Turn visibility hook, so the tail contribution a"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"pplies a narrow presentation compatibility layer to the Chat rows between adjacent Turn tails. Model"},{"id":"p21s5","text":" context deletion does not depend on that compatibility layer."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` and `0.1.0-rc.7`\n- Node.js 22.19 or newer\n- Web profile and Web-base"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ss `0.1.0-rc.6` and `0.1.0-rc.7`\n- Node.js 22.19 or newer\n- Web profile and Web-based desktop shells"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview. After upgrading Harness, verify the plugin once with a dis"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"posable Session containing three short turns and delete the middle one."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`npm run check` type-checks and builds both plugin halves, runs the unit/UI tests, and verifies the "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"npm package contents."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Like every DSH plugin, this package runs with the Harness process's permissions. Review the source b"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"efore installing third-party plugins. The deletion changes future model context but deliberately ret"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ains the original append-only events for audit and replay."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
